# Security headers for all routes. The site is hand-authored static HTML with
# extensive inline script/style and no build step, so the CSP allows
# 'unsafe-inline' (and 'unsafe-eval' for the Elfsight widget). It still pins
# every allowed network origin, which is the practical win available here.
# Origin inventory date: 2026-07-03. If a page adds a new third party, add it
# here in the same commit or the resource will be silently blocked.
# 2026-07-08 analytics restoration: bare analytics.google.com (the *.analytics
# wildcard does NOT match the apex GA4 sends to), www.google.com and
# ad.doubleclick.net (GA4 signals/ccm side-channels), and the Cloudflare Web
# Analytics beacon (static.cloudflareinsights.com script, cloudflareinsights.com
# RUM post). Removing any of these silently kills analytics again; see
# iris-automation docs/knowledge/incidents/2026-07-08-csp-analytics-blackout.md.
# 2026-07-08 Clarity: tag from www.clarity.ms (wildcard), beacons to rotating
# single-letter subdomains (a.clarity.ms etc.) plus c.bing.com; bare clarity.ms
# added deliberately in both directives because wildcards never match the apex.
# 2026-07-21 length fix: Cloudflare Pages silently DROPS any header value over
# 2,000 characters, so the previous 2,094-char CSP never reached browsers.
# Shrunk by (a) writing host sources without the https:// scheme (on this
# HTTPS + HSTS site a scheme-less host matches https only, same enforcement),
# (b) removing r2.dev from media-src/connect-src (R2 serves thumbnail images
# only; img-src keeps it), (c) *.doubleclick.net covering stats.g + ad apexes,
# (d) *.elfsight.com covering static.elfsight.com, (e) dropping unreferenced
# *.vimeocdn.com (Vimeo loads inside its own player.vimeo.com iframe). Keep the
# value under ~1,950 characters or the whole header vanishes again.
# 2026-08-11: worker-src 'self' blob: added. hls.js demuxes in a Web Worker it
# creates from a blob: URL. With no worker-src, CSP fell back to script-src
# (no blob:), the worker was refused, and hls.js silently degraded to
# main-thread demuxing. Playback still worked, so this only showed up as a
# console refusal, but 4K on /yours/<slug> pages stuttered on weaker devices.
# Additive only: nothing could create a blob: worker before this, so no
# existing behaviour changes and no analytics origin is touched.
# 2026-08-11: *.clarity.ms added to img-src. Clarity was in script-src and
# connect-src but never img-src, so its c.clarity.ms/c.gif beacon had been
# refused on every Clarity page since the 7/08 restore. Found while verifying
# the worker-src change; it predates that change and is unrelated to it.
# Session recording still worked (l.clarity.ms/collect returns 204), so only
# the c.gif call was lost. c.bing.com added in the same pass: c.clarity.ms/c.gif
# 302s to c.bing.com/c.gif for the cookie sync, so allowing only the first hop
# just moved the refusal one step down. c.bing.com was already trusted in
# connect-src since 7/08; img-src now matches. Verify BOTH hops after any
# future CSP edit, not just the clarity.ms one.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' www.googletagmanager.com static.cloudflareinsights.com *.clarity.ms clarity.ms connect.facebook.net cdn.jsdelivr.net cdn.vidstack.io challenges.cloudflare.com *.elfsight.com elfsightcdn.com *.elfsightcdn.com www.gstatic.com book.flyiniris.com api.leadconnectorhq.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' fonts.googleapis.com cdn.vidstack.io; font-src 'self' data: fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: pub-353a8c6ef8dc4c03a98225af8b12a8a9.r2.dev www.facebook.com www.googletagmanager.com *.google-analytics.com www.google.com *.elfsight.com *.elfsightcdn.com *.cdninstagram.com *.fbcdn.net *.clarity.ms c.bing.com; media-src 'self' blob: video.flyiniris.com media.flyiniris.com; connect-src 'self' api.flyiniris.com iris-automation.flyin-iris-mp.workers.dev video.flyiniris.com media.flyiniris.com challenges.cloudflare.com *.google-analytics.com analytics.google.com *.analytics.google.com *.doubleclick.net www.google.com cloudflareinsights.com *.clarity.ms clarity.ms c.bing.com www.googletagmanager.com connect.facebook.net www.facebook.com *.elfsight.com *.elfsightcdn.com cdn.jsdelivr.net cdn.vidstack.io www.gstatic.com; frame-src 'self' book.flyiniris.com api.leadconnectorhq.com player.vimeo.com challenges.cloudflare.com www.facebook.com www.googletagmanager.com *.elfsight.com; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' api.flyiniris.com iris-automation.flyin-iris-mp.workers.dev
